olor=#1e1e1e;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="900" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v2" value="종료 코드: 0 정상 · 3 사람 확인 필요(실패 아님) · 2 품질 미달 · 1 오류. 빨간 LLM 배지가 붙은 단계만 LLM을 호출한다(llm 층 경유, 녹음·재생 가능). 색 = 층(cli 파랑 · core 초록 · adapters 노랑 · llm 빨강 · graph 보라 · .cta 회색)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="52" width="1700" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v3" value="cta 명령" style="swimlane;html=1;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;collapsible=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="100" width="1740" height="1120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v4" value="A. cta generate" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=40;horizontal=0;collapsible=0;fillColor=none;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="v3"><mxGeometry x="0" y="30" width="1740" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v5" value="cta generate &lt;파일명&gt; | --class C&#xa;[--max-methods N] [--engine deep] [--fast]" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="v4"><mxGeometry x="60" y="40" width="150" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v6" value="[1/4] 재료 수집 adapters/materials.py&#xa;테스트 없는 메서드 선정 · 확인 항목(분기·경계·예외·null) · 기존 테스트 파일" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v4"><mxGeometry x="280" y="40" width="250" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v7" value="[2/4] 객체 생성법 확인&#xa;직접 생성 / builder / mock" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v4"><mxGeometry x="600" y="40" width="170" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v8" value="[3/4] 작성 엔진 (페이지 1)&#xa;legacy writer_graph | deep core/agent&#xa;쓰기→실행→진단 반복 ≤8회, ⏸ 4회마다 질문" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v4"><mxGeometry x="840" y="40" width="270" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v9" value="LLM" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b85450;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="v4"><mxGeometry x="1074" y="32" width="34" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v10" value="[4/4] 게이트 ①~⑥ (결정적)&#xa;core/submit.py 탈락 사유 → 재생성 ≤3회&#xa;--fast: ④커버리지 ⑤뮤테이션 생략" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v4"><mxGeometry x="1180" y="40" width="250" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v11" value=".cta/proposals&#xa;제안 저장 (소스 미반영)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v4"><mxGeometry x="1500" y="40" width="160" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v12" value="종료 0&#xa;cta diff로 검토" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="v4"><mxGeometry x="1730" y="40" width="110" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e13" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v4" source="v5" target="v6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e14" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v4" source="v6" target="v7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e15" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v4" source="v7" target="v8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e16" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v4" source="v8" target="v10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e17" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v4" source="v10" target="v11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e18" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v4" source="v11" target="v12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v19" value="게이트 재시도 소진 → 사람 확인(종료 3) · 품질 미달(종료 2). --engine deep: --record 파일 / --replay 파일 로 LLM 호출 녹음·재생(기록과 어긋나면 실패, 실호출 폴백 없음). 실행은 sandbox(local 기본 / docker)에서 선택한 테스트만 돈다(R5)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="v4"><mxGeometry x="60" y="135" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v20" value="B. cta maintain" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=40;horizontal=0;collapsible=0;fillColor=none;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="v3"><mxGeometry x="0" y="230" width="1740" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v21" value="cta maintain --diff HEAD~1&#xa;[--plan-only] [--intent 의도]" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="60" y="40" width="150" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v22" value="변경 추출 adapters/changes.py&#xa;git diff → 변경 심볼 + 단서&#xa;(시그니처·접근 제어자·주석만·커밋 메시지·이슈) · 수정 전 소스" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="270" y="40" width="240" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v23" value="건별 의도 분류 llm/intent.py&#xa;bug_fix / refactor / new_feature / trivial / unclear&#xa;+ 확신도·근거·분석. 실패 → unclear · --intent면 확정" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="570" y="40" width="240" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v24" value="LLM" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b85450;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="774" y="32" width="34" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v25" value="기존 테스트 찾기 + 검증 실행&#xa;TestLocator(그래프 COVERS 실측 → 참조 파싱 폴백)&#xa;선택 실행만(R5) → pass / fail / none" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="870" y="40" width="230" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e26" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v20" source="v21" target="v22"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e27" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v20" source="v22" target="v23"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e28" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v20" source="v23" target="v25"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v29" value="규칙표&#xa;core/pipeline/decide.py&#xa;의도 × 테스트 상태&#xa;(LLM 없음, R2)" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="1150" y="30" width="180" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e30" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v20" source="v25" target="v29"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v31" value="bug_fix · new_feature → create_test → A의 [3/4]~[4/4] 경로&#xa;bug_fix: 재발 방지 테스트(⑥회귀 게이트: 수정 전 코드에서 실패해야)&#xa;new_feature: 기능 테스트 → 제안" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="1390" y="50" width="320" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v32" value="no_action&#xa;refactor+통과(동작 보존 확인) · trivial(주석·공백만)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="1390" y="115" width="320" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v33" value="escalate / ask → .cta/escalations 저장 후 멈춤 (종료 3)&#xa;refactor+실패: 기대값을 고치지 않고 실패 내용·의심 위치만 정리(R3)&#xa;unclear / refactor+테스트 없음: 사람에게 묻기" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fce8f6;strokeColor=#b5739d;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="1390" y="170" width="320" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e34" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v20" source="v29" target="v31"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e35" value="refactor+pass · trivial" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v20" source="v29" target="v32"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1240" y="135"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e36" value="refactor+fail · unclear" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v20" source="v29" target="v33"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1240" y="200"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v37" value="화면에는 변경 건마다 ①의도 판단 ②조치 블록(판단·확신도·근거·할 일)을 적는다(ADR-0015 D2). 확신도는 표시용이며 코드는 이 값으로 분기하지 않는다. --plan-only는 규칙표까지만. 판단 메모(.cta/memos)에 비슷한 결정이 있으면 참고로 보여 준다. 사람 확인이 하나라도 있으면 종료 3." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="60" y="235" width="1600" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v38" value="C. cta resolve" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=40;horizontal=0;collapsible=0;fillColor=none;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="v3"><mxGeometry x="0" y="530" width="1740" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v39" value="cta resolve &lt;id&gt; --intended |&#xa;--test-issue | --proceed | --as | --skip" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="v38"><mxGeometry x="60" y="40" width="150" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v40" value="저장된 사람 확인 항목 읽기&#xa;.cta/escalations/&lt;id&gt;.json&#xa;재개 지점 = 테스트 작성 단계 진입(ADR-0015 D3)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v38"><mxGeometry x="280" y="40" width="250" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v41" value="사람 결정 → 지침·허용 목록 cli/resolve_cmd.py&#xa;--intended: 실패 테스트 기대값을 새 동작 기준으로&#xa;--test-issue: 테스트를 동작 기준으로 재작성&#xa;--as 의도: 규칙표부터 다시(LLM 없음) · --skip: 기록만" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v38"><mxGeometry x="600" y="40" width="300" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v42" value="A의 [3/4]~[4/4] 경로로 재개&#xa;허용 목록 = 실패한 테스트 메서드만 assert 변경 허용&#xa;나머지는 ①AssertIntegrity 게이트가 보호" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v38"><mxGeometry x="970" y="40" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v43" value="LLM" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b85450;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="v38"><mxGeometry x="1214" y="32" width="34" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v44" value=".cta/proposals 제안&#xa;+ .cta/memos 판단 메모" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v38"><mxGeometry x="1320" y="40" width="170" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v45" value="종료 0 / 2 / 3" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="v38"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="40" width="110" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e46" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v38" source="v39" target="v40"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e47" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v38" source="v40" target="v41"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e48" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v38" source="v41" target="v42"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e49" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v38" source="v42" target="v44"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e50" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v38" source="v44" target="v45"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v51" value="사람이 명시적으로 고른 선택지만 실행한다 — R3는 '사람 확인 없는' 기대값 갱신을 막는 규칙이다. 판단 메모는 다음 maintain에서 키워드 검색으로 참고 자료가 된다." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;" vertex=